# Push changes immediately

After each completed code or docs change in this project, commit and push to `origin` (`git@github.com:NurHasber/PC-Admin-bot.git`) without waiting to be asked.

- Stage only the files from that change. Do not commit `env.env`, `.env`, tokens, keys, `chat_history.sqlite`, logs, or `.venv`.
- Write a short commit message about why the change was made.
- Push the current branch to `origin`. Do not force-push.
- If the push fails, say so and leave the commit in place.
